# Negative-control TDD smoke for run_cmsis_nn_raise.sh. Confirms the
# raise runner returns non-zero when handed a synthetic row whose
# expected symbol cannot survive raising. Wires the negative shell
# driver into lit so a regression that masks pass/fail propagation
# would surface under check-fabric.
#
# RUN: bash -c 'set -o pipefail; bash %S/../cmsis-nn/test_runner_negative.sh' | FileCheck %s
#
# CHECK: PASS (runner correctly classified synthetic row as FAIL with rc=1)
